el Peace Prize in 2002 for his efforts to find peaceful solutions to international conflicts.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae63-7e89-b006-47eb723d40f6","description":"Jimmy Carter","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae63-7ff4-8e1a-061c516b95d0","description":"George W. Bush","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae63-7c52-ad2f-c9ad5d01b023","description":"Ronald Reagan","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae63-7c2a-88a4-47ba30313bae","description":"Grover Cleveland","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae64-7825-b851-c20f7bc5ad7a","category":"01a21312-b489-7ebc-94f2-41649ebfcaca","question":"Which WWII general was nicknamed \'The Desert Fox\'?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Rommel led the Afrika Korps in North Africa, where his campaigns made him well known to Allied forces.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae64-799a-a635-bd258f8a9539","description":"Rommel","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae64-79ab-acf8-c12f8b025cf8","description":"MacArthur","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae64-7083-ab0a-3fab72d6becf","description":"Montgomery","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae64-7874-89f2-6d0d534c8d49","description":"Zhukov","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae64-703a-bbce-5f77fad4eea8","category":"01a21312-b489-7ebc-94f2-41649ebfcaca","question":"Who was the 15th president of the USA, in term during the period 1857\u20131861?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"James Buchanan was the last president before Abraham Lincoln; the secession crisis deepened during Buchanan\u2019s term.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae64-76fc-b3fc-20ae83f75d68","description":"James Buchanan","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae64-7138-9fd0-5719ef98c75d","description":"Rutherford B. Hayes","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae64-720e-966a-031797c2a0cc","description":"Woodrow Wilson","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae64-7579-bef5-28eb48c355c2","description":"Abraham Lincoln","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae64-73ee-a179-b0cb4c0