za?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"According to the popular story, Margherita of Savoy was served the pizza in Naples, where its toppings echoed the colors of the Italian flag.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae64-7eb7-864f-3d5899bb9ef2","description":"Margherita of Savoy","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae64-72b9-91f8-9a0be0d3fe10","description":"Elena of Montenegro","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae64-7115-9f58-bf7ad44b7289","description":"Maria Jos\u00e9 of Belgium","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae64-7be9-887e-c9eca83b7034","description":"Adelaide of Savoy","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae64-715d-a36b-ce6d680b29ed","category":"01a21312-b489-7ebc-94f2-41649ebfcaca","question":"Which of these people was a leader of the Hunnic empire?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Attila led campaigns against both the Eastern and Western Roman Empires during the fifth century.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae64-7817-b9c0-52de79b95e3b","description":"Attila","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae64-7822-b6c3-b85ab7cbdfc9","description":"Leonidas","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae64-706e-9ca9-123becf83c02","description":"Ariston","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae64-7fb3-b93c-d8793cbf361e","description":"Anaxander","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae64-7bf8-8a6d-fcd33cad5eb8","category":"01a21312-b489-7ebc-94f2-41649ebfcaca","question":"During which conflict did the Abu Ghraib scandal occur?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"The Iraq War scandal centered on abuse by U.S. personnel at Abu Ghraib prison; photographs released in 2004 prompted international outrage.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae64-70ab-84fa-10b338f4c709","description":"Iraq War","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae64-7053-a99e-167898a296c8","description":"The Vietnam War","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae64-7c77-89d1-5791df23fee8","description":"The Ukraine War","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae64-75ac-9908-adb847b4f656","des