dult cell?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Dolly the sheep was born in 1996 at the Roslin Institute.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae64-7f3e-8deb-d2d22409ec5e","description":"1996","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae64-724a-9ad7-a43e54369932","description":"1986","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae64-7c40-8b45-202f7ee2f593","description":"1991","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae64-76ee-ad16-99ac7047bfd8","description":"2001","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae64-7310-8f28-814951474d21","category":"01a21312-b489-7ebc-94f2-41649ebfcaca","question":"Who was Napoleon\'s first wife?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Josephine de Beauharnais became empress when Napoleon was crowned emperor. Their marriage was later annulled because they had no heir together.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae64-7b25-8acc-0c6817cf666d","description":"Josephine de Beauharnais","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae64-747e-9ab2-1e642abb0736","description":"Marie Louise of Austria","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae64-7b73-9dbc-c809b8cb57ec","description":"Maria Walewska","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae64-747c-87f6-41444df88c91","description":"Marie Antoinette","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae64-7d86-beb2-1deedfed8912","category":"01a21312-b489-7ebc-94f2-41649ebfcaca","question":"Which ancient ruler was known as the \"Scourge of God\"?","difficulty":3,"explanation":"Attila the Huns led campaigns against both the Eastern and Western Roman Empires, helping make him one of Rome\u2019s most feared foes.","alternatives":[{"id":"01a2190a-ae65-7970-8f3a-ba225134ce13","description":"Attila the Huns","correct_answer":true},{"id":"01a2190a-ae65-7511-a49f-55ad6c8b9de1","description":"Vlad the Impaler","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae65-7fc2-82ed-259186121c41","description":"Ivan the Terrible","correct_answer":false},{"id":"01a2190a-ae65-73ba-a23d-fdecb2c56aed","description":"Xerxes","correct_answer":false}]},{"id":"01a2190a-ae65-7